msgid "MSC Scheduled Visibility"
msgstr "MSC Scheduled Visibility"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: msc-scheduled-visibility.php
msgid "https://github.com/djm56/msc-scheduled-visibility"
msgstr "https://github.com/djm56/msc-scheduled-visibility"

#. Description of the plugin
#: msc-scheduled-visibility.php
msgid "Schedule posts and pages to appear and disappear between specific dates and times. Includes block-level scheduling, recurring schedules, role-based visibility, WooCommerce product scheduling, quick/bulk edit, schedule preview, history and a REST API."
msgstr "特定の日時間間で投稿やページを表示・非表示にすることができます。ブロック別スケジュール、定期スケジュール、ロール別可視性、WooCommerce商品スケジュール、クイック/一括編集、スケジュールプレビュー、履歴、およびREST APIを含めます。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: msc-scheduled-visibility.php
msgid "Anomalous Developers"
msgstr "Anomalous Developers"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: msc-scheduled-visibility.php
msgid "https://anomalous.co.za"
msgstr "https://anomalous.co.za"

